{"synopsis":"Sepanjang sejarah, banyak legenda beredar tentang keberadaan alam spiritual. Keyakinan ini diperdebatkan sama banyak cendekiawan dari berbagai dinasti, termasuk satu puisi yang bilang: ‘Dari dinasti Qi sampai Tang, gunung ini tandus dan sepi, alam spiritual sunyi dan jarang dikunjungi. Alam spiritual enggak bisa dijelasin, dan bahkan jejak kerjaan hantu pun susah dicari.’","alternative_title":"Lingjing Xingzhe, Língjìng Xíngzhě, Mystic Domain, Spirit Realm Walker, Spiritual Realm Walker, 灵境行者","author":"Yingzhiyao","artist":"Yingzhiyao","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"76e76c88-debe-49bd-b166-2053154d5dc1","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"0ed3bb20-0de4-4780-8e3c-f9a1ecf1b76c","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"12e3fedf-af2e-46b6-825a-1179f6a0581e","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"aed6c396-a7da-4cf7-9ccb-4104f60a860b","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"eec68a94-4e88-4b33-8adc-904b723c4ecd","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"ff91ae76-1956-4b3b-afc2-c2b6d6d995b8","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"40aa1804-fdff-49c6-9977-b9ecd130231d","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"6e2fb270-1cf9-4e55-bb68-ee3ae390eeb9","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"2f587a14-76af-4165-826c-6cc55a7b7b27","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"af05cf7e-e8db-4bf9-9ca0-a4e0f522d7f1","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"0d430726-61b7-485f-8890-7d2b40732f68"